    AUTOCHECKBOX    "Play a &sound", IDC_REMSOUND, 15, 58, 270, 10
    AUTOCHECKBOX    "Send &e-mail alerts for reminders set to ""E-mail""", IDC_REMEMAIL, 15, 74, 270, 10
    PUSHBUTTON      "&Test notification", IDC_TESTNOTIFY, 7, 102, 80, 14
    LTEXT           "Reminders are checked every 20 seconds while WinCalendar is running (it keeps running in the notification area when minimized). E-mail alerts use your default MAPI mail program.", -1, 7, 124, 286, 40
